            "created_at": "2025-08-27T20:33:42.931612+00:00",
            "notes": "In the early game, play safely behind your tank.\n\nFocus on your survival, you can extend when needed but quickly stepback behind your lines.\n\n[Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) is here to farm your rally but it also enable your one shot combo on squishes.\n\nKeep inspire up with your whip to built your ult faster and capitalize on [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) .\n\nDon\u2019t hesitate to rally early.",
