            "created_at": "2025-08-27T20:33:42.931612+00:00",
            "notes": "With  [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753) ,  [Hardlight Weave](item_0e674b2f-4048-4fc9-be6d-95d51d2ae33b) and  [Squire's Satchel](item_b530e529-3bf4-4b7c-abe8-6e976a5c35bf) synergy, your shield should be near 1700hp.\nYou can directly shield your tank when he gets critical.\n\nIf you manage to ult many time during each round, you can choose to buy  [Dragon's Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) instead of  [Hardlight Weave](item_0e674b2f-4048-4fc9-be6d-95d51d2ae33b) . \nHowever your shield will suffer a 1000hp loss (around 670hp). So evaluate depending on team comp and how the game is going.",
